- [Ceridian Dayforce](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/dayforce): Use Pebl's Dayforce integrations to extend into new markets with synced employee data, global onboarding, and localized payroll and compliance.
- [Coupa](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/coupa): Use Pebl’s Coupa integration to unify global workforce data with total spend management, and improve visibility into expenses and contractor payments.
- [Expensify](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/expensify): Use Pebl’s Expensify integration to simplify global expenses, reimbursements, and workforce-related spend while improving visibility and compliance.
- [Greenhouse](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/greenhouse): Use Greenhouse integrations with Pebl to connect structured hiring data with global onboarding, bi-directional sync, and faster international hiring at scale.
- [Gusto](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/gusto): Use Gusto integrations with Pebl to connect domestic HR and payroll with global onboarding, employment updates, and compliance in 185+ countries.
- [JazzHR](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/jazzhr): Use Pebl’s JazzHR integration to move top candidates into global onboarding, automate compliant contracts, and accelerate global hiring in 185 countries.
- [Lever](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/lever): Use Pebl's HR software Lever integrations to get hired candidates into global onboarding, sync profile details, and simplify employment agreement.
- [Namely](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/namely): Use Pebl’s Namely integration to automate onboarding, sync employee and employment data, and keep HR records accurate across global teams.
- [NetSuite](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/netsuite): Use Pebl’s NetSuite integration to align global ERP, accounting, and inventory with your international workforce while auto syncing payroll and labor costs.
- [Oracle](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/oracle): Use Pebl’s Oracle HCM Cloud integration to sync global workforce data, automate onboarding updates, and support international payroll and compliance.
- [Quickbooks](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/quickbooks): Use Pebl’s QuickBooks integration to link small business accounting with global payroll, expense tracking, and invoice sync for better financial visibility.
- [Ramp](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/ramp): Use Ramp integrations with Pebl to automate invoice sync, connect global workforce operations to spend management, and improve ledger visibility.
- [Sage Intacct](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/sage-intacct): Use Sage Intacct integrations with Pebl to connect workforce data with financial management, and improve dimensional reporting and invoice automation.
- [SAP Concur](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/sap-concur): Use Pebl’s SAP Concur integration to streamline global travel, expense, and invoice data while improving compliance and visibility into workforce spend.
- [Slack](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/slack): Use Slack integrations with Pebl to link global workforce events with real-time communication, no-code automation, and better collaboration across teams.
- [TSheets](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/tsheets): Use TSheets integrations with Pebl to sync hours worked, support payroll accuracy, and improve workforce visibility across globally distributed teams.
- [UKG Pro](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/ukg-pro): Use UKG Pro integrations with Pebl to connect your HCM platform with global payroll, onboarding updates, and synced workforce data in 185 countries.
- [Workable](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/workable): Use Workable integrations with Pebl to bridge recruiting and global employment, sync candidate data, and streamline compliant global hiring workflows.
- [Workday](https://hellopebl.com/integrations/workday): Use Pebl’s Workday integration to unify global enterprise HR and finance data, automate onboarding updates, and support global payroll and compliance.

